  npcId: Mom
  npcName: Girlfriend's Mom
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - "\u201CI was thinking of stopping by this afternoon. I haven't seen you two in ages! \u201D "
  - '"Next weekend works! I''ll bring that cake you both love. And don''t forget to tell her to call me!" '
  - '"A gardening emergency? Should I bring a shovel? Gloves? Do you need me to call someone?"   '
  - "\u201CThe house is CLOSED? What does that even mean? Are you renovating? Is my daughter okay? I'm coming over. \""
